AI Impact Ledger is an independent implementation by Miles Sowden.

Design inspiration and research inputs:

- ClaudeCodeUsage, github.com/ryoppippi/ClaudeCodeUsage, reviewed at commit
  6656714611f98600f0f8ec034ba23141a3ee4fc0 (v2.3.1).
- Claude Code Energy Monitor, github.com/Magnus-Gille/claude-code-energy-monitor,
  reviewed at commit a5192eb. Its token attribution research informed early
  testing. Its energy coefficients were used until version 0.3.0 and have been
  replaced: the current ranges are derived from primary sources in
  docs/evidence/energy-derivation.md.

No source code from either project is included in version 0.3.0. Their ideas,
published findings and public documentation informed the product specification
and methodology. See docs/provenance.md.

Environmental and pricing figures are derived from published sources credited
in src/data/impact-registry.v1.json and docs/evidence/energy-derivation.md. No
source content is redistributed.
